# OS-HAS-NO-NERVOUS-SYSTEM — wire the ADVISORY next-best-action router as a
# recurring timer-organ. scripts/coord/next-best-action.sh COMPUTES and EMITS a
# ranked list of next-best-actions by EV = value x P(success), reading the
# sighted organs that already price work (pr-book-model.jq P(merge), the
# faculty self-portrait, journey odds, open gaps, failed organs). It RECOMMENDS
# and LOGS only — it never dispatches a worker, merges a PR, or restarts an
# organ (autonomy is earned only after its recommendations prove calibrated).
#
# The engine existed but its output was computed ONCE and abandoned: ~/.chump/
# next-best-action.json went 8 days stale. This unit keeps the NBA output fresh
# so the nervous system (duty-officer, board, operator) always reads a current
# ranking instead of a dark, week-old file. Paired with
# chump-next-best-action.timer; rostered in scripts/ops/organ-manifest.txt so
# organ-reconcile + organ-deploy keep it alive (RESILIENT-366 / RESILIENT-374).
#
# INFRA-8194 (Phase R R5): placeholder TEMPLATE. __HOME__ / __REPO_ROOT__ are
# resolved per host by `chump node render-unit` (crates/chump-provision) or its
# shell mirror organ_unit_host_rewrite (install-helsinki-atc.sh,
# chump-node-install.sh). No User= line: the renderer injects User=<run-user>
# for a system-scope install only, never for a --user manager (217/USER).
[Unit]
Description=Chump next-best-action — recompute the EV-ranked advisory action list + emit kind=next_best_action (recommend-only)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
Environment=HOME=__HOME__
Environment=PATH=__HOME__/.cargo/bin:__REPO_ROOT__/target/release:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
Environment=CHUMP_REPO_ROOT=__REPO_ROOT__
WorkingDirectory=__REPO_ROOT__
# Source providers.env + cj.env for parity with the other CJ organs (gh token,
# per-node config). The NBA router itself makes no LLM call — it only reads
# already-computed fleet state (pr-book, faculty, gaps, failed organs) — so it
# is cheap and cannot contend the model cascade.
ExecStart=/bin/bash -lc 'source __REPO_ROOT__/scripts/dispatch/lib/load-provider-auth.env __HOME__/.chump/providers.env __HOME__/.chump/cj.env 2>/dev/null; cd __REPO_ROOT__; exec bash scripts/coord/next-best-action.sh'
TimeoutStartSec=300
